{"q":"60","t":"Permutation Sequence","d":"Hard","p":false,"c":"<p>The set <code>[1, 2, 3, ...,&nbsp;n]</code> contains a total of <code>n!</code> unique permutations.</p>\n\n<p>By listing and labeling all of the permutations in order, we get the following sequence for <code>n = 3</code>:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li><code>&quot;123&quot;</code></li>\n\t<li><code>&quot;132&quot;</code></li>\n\t<li><code>&quot;213&quot;</code></li>\n\t<li><code>&quot;231&quot;</code></li>\n\t<li><code>&quot;312&quot;</code></li>\n\t<li><code>&quot;321&quot;</code></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>Given <code>n</code> and <code>k</code>, return the <code>k<sup>th</sup></code> permutation sequence.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> n = 3, k = 3\n<strong>Output:</strong> \"213\"\n</pre><p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> n = 4, k = 9\n<strong>Output:</strong> \"2314\"\n</pre><p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> n = 3, k = 1\n<strong>Output:</strong> \"123\"\n</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= n &lt;= 9</code></li>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= k &lt;= n!</code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"getPermutation\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"n\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"k\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"string\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"Recursion","slug":"recursion"}],"s":[{"t":"Next Permutation","s":"next-permutation","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Permutations","s":"permutations","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Meta","facebook"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["Turing","turing"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Jump Trading","jump-trading"],["X","twitter"]],"cs":{"a":[["Google","google",2],["Amazon","amazon",2]],"b":[["Bloomberg","bloomberg",4],["Meta","facebook",2],["Turing","turing",2]],"m":[["Microsoft","microsoft",5],["Jump Trading","jump-trading",3]]}}